Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error on the full pool to see if weighting improves over the robust mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination over the full pool to see if it improves over mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed mean on the full pool to see if trimming outliers improves over the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test the best single model hypothesis by selecting ARIMA as the sole predictor, to see if a single strong model outperforms the robust combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ARIMA"}

Thought: Test a DBA combination on the full pool to see if a more sophisticated robust method improves over the simple mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the best single model candidate rf to see if it beats the mean baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination on the smaller, more correlated pool1 using inverse error weighting to see if focusing on the top performers improves SMAPE.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the full pool using the pooled_meta_model weight (w1) to see if a meta-model weighting improves over inverse_error and mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination with inverse_error on the smaller, high‑performing pool1 to see if a simpler weighting beats the meta‑model.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean over the smaller, high-performing pool1 to see if reducing variance improves over weighted w1.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Evaluate a weighted combination on the full pool using inverse_error weights to see if it outperforms the current best weighted w1 strategy.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a slightly larger pool improves over pool1 results.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination over the high‑performing pool1 to see if it beats the current weighted winner and reduces variance across windows.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

